ind mount，不是声明的容器 tmpfs。\n3. consumer gate 只报告 Maven 是否存在，并未执行 Maven consumer；JAR/POM/BOM/sources/javadoc 也没有汇入最终 release staging。\n4. SBOM/signing 在未清空的同一输出目录上自举，可能纳入旧失败产物；签名只覆盖顶层文件。provenance 使用未暂存 index tree，当前 dirty tree 会被错误绑定为 Stage 5 tree。\n5. Remote rollback 新逻辑在候选尚未 activation 时也无条件停止现有 service，安装包上传/解包早期失败可中断正常旧 Host。\n\n这些都直接来自 Stage 6 package/performance/rollback 退出条件，省略会造成错误 green 或升级回归。我会先为它们补最小合同并修正实现，再做 Ubuntu JI-only 容量检查。","startedSeq":942,"endedSeq":1261,"startedAt":"1788751279Z","endedAt":"1788751285Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":2860,"revision":1261,"observedAt":"1788751285Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788750777Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788751285Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2352,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788750777,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788751285,"revision":1261,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_07de85f9a9485b87016a9e2d5e795087d08267d9bbab4125ca","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-1266","seq":1266,"timestamp":"1788751300Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":1266,"endedSeq":1657,"startedAt":"1788751300Z","endedAt":"1788752127Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":1266,"activityEndSeq":1657,"totalEventCount":58,"toolCallCount":44,"thoughtCount":14,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":6,"writtenFileCount":12,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0177ec3f1eea9459016a9e30ed815087d0b3f49e94bf3e7321","seq":1753,"timestamp":"1788752128Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"68e1f968-54b4-496d-bb99-eaef21509c3d","content":"关键实现修正已通过本地合同与聚焦回归。现在进入外部门禁：先调用同一个 JI-only Ubuntu runner；它只删除列明的 `ji-stage6-*` 容器、镜像和目录，然后要求根文件系统至少 20 GiB 可用。若仍不足，会在任何构建、性能写入或非 JI 操作前以 `STAGE6_CAPACITY_BLOCKER` 终止。","startedSeq":